{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the near future, the Earth has become uninhabitable due to a devastating war. Humanity was forced to leave its planet and look for a new home in space. Players take on the role of space travelers who must explore different planets and collect resources to survive in this new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/637cd7736c814de202807369c07ccf22.poster.avif?t=1770998660\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/637cd7736c814de202807369c07ccf22.webm?t=1770998660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/637cd7736c814de202807369c07ccf22.mp4?t=1770998660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers players a wide range of planets to explore, each with its own unique features and resources. From desert worlds with rare resources to rich planets with valuable minerals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/caae4e50ce011095c4f0f1f55885edbc.poster.avif?t=1770998660\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/caae4e50ce011095c4f0f1f55885edbc.webm?t=1770998660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/caae4e50ce011095c4f0f1f55885edbc.mp4?t=1770998660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Wide range of planets to explore;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Gathering resources and meeting needs;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Interact with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/1923276d253327d7457fbfa6389f1310.poster.avif?t=1770998660\" width=600 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/1923276d253327d7457fbfa6389f1310.webm?t=1770998660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/1923276d253327d7457fbfa6389f1310.mp4?t=1770998660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an exciting journey through space in which players must survive, explore and interact with the world around them. It offers a unique survival experience in space and the opportunity to forge your own path in this new universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/725daca578b0bf4016234bda1026bc1a.poster.avif?t=1770998660\" width=636 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/725daca578b0bf4016234bda1026bc1a.webm?t=1770998660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/725daca578b0bf4016234bda1026bc1a.mp4?t=1770998660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1935810?t=1770998660","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/